# API Boundaries

- Put new public endpoints under `apps/admin/server/api/v1`.
- Keep routing versioned and resource-oriented. Do not add unversioned API paths.
- Validate request bodies, params, and query values with Zod, preferring shared schemas from `@douyin/shared`.
- Use `useDb()` from `apps/admin/server/utils/db` instead of creating direct database clients inside handlers.
- Return stable error payloads through `sendAppError()`.
- Keep handler logic thin when possible by moving reusable logic into `server/utils`.
- Preserve the core boundary: only Nitro talks to Neon, and clients talk to Nitro over HTTP.
